<title>SLOVAKIA: Details of Q1-Q3 GDP from Slovak Stats Bureau.</title>
<headline>Details of Q1-Q3 GDP from Slovak Stats Bureau.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are details of Slovak GDP for the third quarter, as released by the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) on Thursday.</p>
<p> GROSS DOMESTIC PRODUCT    Jan-Sep'96 Q3'96 Jan-Sep'95 Q3'95</p>
<p> real change yr/yr (pct)	+7.0    +6.9    +6.5	+8.2</p>
<p> absolute amount (skk bln)   432.7   152.7   383.0     135.4</p>
<p>(pct change)</p>
<p> household demand		 +7.8    +7.7    +6.6    -0.2</p>
<p> state administration demand +25.2   +29.0    -1.6    -1.1</p>
<p> gross capital creation	+30.5   +36.4    -0.9    +1.8</p>
<p> exports of goods/services    -3.9    +1.1     n/a    +6.4</p>
<p> imports of goods/services   +15.4   +27.3     n/a    +1.2</p>
<p>Note. All figures are subject to revision.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
